t bank  president  vernon hoyer speaking to us live from  luxembourg  ladies and gentlemen colleagues and  friends  i'm delighted to welcome you on behalf  of the european investment bank to this  important conference  a special welcome to our co-organizer of  the european commission under the  leadership of oslo thunder line  and her executive vice presidents by liz  dombroskis and franz timmermans  thank you very much

